      "generator": "OpenAI built-in ImageGen",
      "prompt": "A strict 3 columns by 2 rows atlas with SIX poses of the exact reference game wolf recolored as the black shrine wolf, warm ink-black and blue-charcoal fur with legible ink-gray highlights and same bell and collar. Wolves occupy equal-cell footprint, feet aligned low, facing right. 1 idle four paws planted, 2 idle alert, 3 run extended, 4 run gathered, 5 run mid-stride with rear foot planted, 6 run landing. Life-like athletic wolf motion. Isolated hand-painted raster sprite, true transparent alpha background, Japanese ukiyo-e sumi-e, finely inked contours and natural washi brush grain, game side view wolf facing right, existing asset is anatomy and proportions guide, white wolf uses same navy collar with small golden bell. No text, grid, rectangular backdrop, shadow plane or scenery. Full body within each cell with separated transparent gutters."
    },
    "wolf-bites": {
      "path": "art/skills/shikigami/sources/stage78/wolf-bites.png",
      "sha256": "6dba9246eba26c60960ebe8c7f0e937e78a0551561b3eb06e30535784419b3ed",
      "generator": "OpenAI built-in ImageGen",
      "prompt": "Strict 4 columns by 2 rows sprite atlas, wide landscape. First row four poses of the matching white wolf; second row four poses of the same animal in ink black and blue-charcoal. Each row horizontally in order: ears angled and weight pulled back in anticipation; forward lunge with jaw wide open; jaws snap closed with forelegs firmly planted; head retracts eyes still fixed right. Make four silhouettes clearly different with precise consistent athletic fur identity, dark blue bell collar. No enemy, background or magic effects. Isolated hand-painted raster sprite, true transparent alpha background, Japanese ukiyo-e sumi-e, finely inked contours and natural washi brush grain, game side view wolf facing right, existing asset is anatomy and proportions guide, white wolf uses same navy collar with small golden bell. No text, grid, rectangular backdrop, shadow plane or scenery. Full body within each cell with separated transparent gutters."
    },
