      "generator": "OpenAI built-in ImageGen",
      "prompt": "A vertical portrait illustration for a game skill card with no frame, text or labels: two Japanese shrine wolf shikigami, broad white in front and black at its flank, leaning alert, collars with small ancient bells, behind them flowing cyan and pale amber smoke, diagonal ink brush shadows and cream washi. Hero image fills canvas, blank safe margins, stylized half sumi-e, half ukiyo-e, emphatic print contours, hand-painted muted indigo ochre. Clear at playing-card size. No typography. Use reference for wolf proportions."
    },
